# Testing Functionality on TR Hub

## OOBE
* Launch TR Hub
* Display OOBE on the first launch of TR Hub

// The firmware update steps might not need be necessary in most of the time
## Disable A3 glasses Firmware Update 
* Launch TR Hub without clear cache
* Select "No" on updating A3 glasses firmware

## Enable A3 glasses Firmware Update
* Launch TR Hub
* Select "Yes" on updating A3 glasses firmware
* Wait for user to re-plug the A3 glasses and check firmware information
